            "title": "National Crime Agency Surface on the site",
            "description": "It is no surprise that the government lurk this site for unethical and illegal practices. On Dec. 12, the National Crime Agency (NCA) were the very first to surface on Hack Forums and actually post. Not many took heed of the NCA until Omniscient proceeded to then post confirmation of the authoritative figures behind the account. The message/unintentional warning came shortly after law enforcement targeted over 100 people who took part in committing DDoS attacks. Congratulations on achieving L33t, NCA. >>Source",
            "url": "http://hackforums.net/showthread.php?tid=5491746",
            "users": [],
            "tags": [
                "drama"
            ]
        },
